{"availability":"available","full":"Het161/DHANRAKSHAK","name":"DHANRAKSHAK","description":"On-device scam guardian for rural India — runs the real detector on the phone, explains the trick in Gujarati, and works with no internet at all","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":6,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-23T06:15:20Z","updated":"2026-08-16T07:15:41Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["ai-safety","fastapi","fintech","fraud-detection","gujarati","lightgbm","nextjs","offline-first","on-device-ml","pwa","upi"],"demo":"https://dhanrakshakai.netlify.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:42.265Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:42.265Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:42.265Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:58:42.265Z","stars":6,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A scam guardian that runs the real detector on your phone — in your language, even with no internet.","Last October the Prime Minister warned the whole country about \"digital arrest\" scams on Mann Ki Baat — fake police who threaten arrest to extort money. Losses run into hundreds of crores, and the people who lose the most are first-time, elderly, and rural users who just got a smartphone and a bank account. The scam-checkers that already exist are English-only, need the internet, and assume a tech-savvy user. Rural Gujarat — patchy signal, low digital literacy, Gujarati speakers — is left out. That is exactly who we built for."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Het161/DHANRAKSHAK/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"43b42f5341c5d536c9aa91926de8398173a0da626d3c7bac1a8d427b31121d60","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:42.411Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:42.411Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A scam guardian that runs the real detector on your phone — in your language, even with no internet.","sourceUrl":"https://gi